Description: Companion package to 'rOpenSci' statistical software review
    project ('rOpenSci' authors, 2021; <doi:10.5281/zenodo.5556756>), to
    facilitate documenting software compliance with statistical standards
    using 'Roxygen2' 'roclets'.
